WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }
::cue(c.colora8c7fa) { color: #a8c7fa; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Premium</c></b>
Keep the project alive: <c.colora8c7fa>ko-fi.com/not6ip</c>

2
00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:14.530
Beyond the heavy rain is a rainbow
hageshii ame no mukou kakaru niji wo mita

3
00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:26.170
I'll know the easy answer's a lie
tayasui kotae wa uso dato shiru darou

4
00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:31.880
Vow not to back down to the shouting
dekai koe nanka ni makenai to chikatte

5
00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:35.630
I need you alone to understand tomorrow
anata hitori ni wakatte hoshii ashita

6
00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:40.770
You gave me the time of my life
yume no youna jikan kureta anata

7
00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:51.280
What do I look like? An ANGEL or a DEVIL...
watashi wa dou mieteruno? sorega tenshi ka akuma ka

8
00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:56.240
Beyond the dawn, beyond the dawn
yoake no mukou yoake no mukou

9
00:00:56.240 --> 00:01:01.740
There's so much I want to tell you
hanashitai koto takusan arun da

10
00:01:01.870 --> 00:01:06.540
Filled with love, with love
ai kometa ai kometa

11
00:01:06.670 --> 00:01:12.460
That can't be written down in a letter
tegami ni kakikirenai omoi da

12
00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:20.890
A small hand in search of eternity
eien wo sagashita chiisana tenohira

13
00:01:32.190 --> 00:01:33.360
Wait!

14
00:01:36.700 --> 00:01:38.950
Kuma! Are you okay?

15
00:01:39.070 --> 00:01:39.910
Kuma!

16
00:01:40.280 --> 00:01:41.990
I-I'm okay!

17
00:01:42.030 --> 00:01:44.080
It's nothing!

18
00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:45.960
That's my boy, Kuma!

19
00:01:49.300 --> 00:01:51.130
Your mother's dead...

20
00:01:51.180 --> 00:01:52.970
She should be in heaven by now.

21
00:01:53.430 --> 00:01:55.010
I think...

22
00:01:55.950 --> 00:01:56.920
...she's better off that way.

23
00:01:58.340 --> 00:02:00.760
Hey, Kuma. You're strong.

24
00:02:01.510 --> 00:02:03.890
Endure! Endure and survive!

25
00:02:05.930 --> 00:02:07.310
Shut up-eh!

26
00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:13.860
Hold it right there!

27
00:02:16.740 --> 00:02:18.490
I choose life!

28
00:02:18.530 --> 00:02:20.490
How about you guys?!

29
00:02:25.830 --> 00:02:32.340
<b>"A History Erased!
God Valley of Despair"</b>

30
00:02:33.630 --> 00:02:35.590
<b>God Valley, West Blue</b>

31
00:02:39.090 --> 00:02:43.260
Now, today's prey is released!

32
00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:48.270
The 13 Super Rare Rabbits that we've already
introduced are worth 10,000 points each!

33
00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:51.350
And there are also 150 Rare Rabbits!

34
00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:54.730
Any one-hit kill will earn you
an "Excellent Bonus"!

35
00:02:54.770 --> 00:02:59.450
And we have some fine prizes
for the champion!

36
00:03:00.570 --> 00:03:02.320
Watch, children...

37
00:03:02.820 --> 00:03:04.410
I won't let you win, Garling.

38
00:03:04.870 --> 00:03:06.740
The Manmayers will get the trophy!

39
00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:14.250
Not so fast! Follow the rules!

40
00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:21.880
This is wrong!
Please tell me this is just a nightmare!

41
00:03:22.010 --> 00:03:25.010
Humans should not treat
other humans as toys--

42
00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:28.220
My child!

43
00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:33.350
We're gonna pull off this operation
at any cost!

44
00:03:33.400 --> 00:03:34.610
So, get fired up!

45
00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:36.070
Yeah!

46
00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:41.700
There are 200 World Noble hunters!

47
00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:44.780
The hunt will begin an hour from now!

48
00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:47.450
Now, run!

49
00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:53.250
<b>Marine Headquarters</b>

50
00:03:53.370 --> 00:03:55.210
God Valley?

51
00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:57.630
Why should I go to such a remote island?!

52
00:03:57.960 --> 00:04:00.970
I can't tell you that! But please, Garp!

53
00:04:01.090 --> 00:04:01.720
No!

54
00:04:02.380 --> 00:04:04.340
We're not certain,

55
00:04:04.390 --> 00:04:06.430
but we can't take any chances!

56
00:04:06.850 --> 00:04:09.470
Is it the Celestial Dragons' school trip?

57
00:04:09.520 --> 00:04:13.600
I told you not to poke the Beehive!
You can't screw with them.

58
00:04:14.150 --> 00:04:16.440
That was treasure from Pirate Island.

59
00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:18.940
Of course, they'll come to take it back.

60
00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:22.200
I wonder where the 
 information leaked from.

61
00:04:22.700 --> 00:04:25.070
You've got plenty of eyes on them,
don't you?

62
00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:26.410
Why are you scared?

63
00:04:27.280 --> 00:04:28.740
Well, we didn't expect...

64
00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:31.910
...Roger would get involved...

65
00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:33.120
Say that part first!

66
00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:34.580
I'm going!

67
00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:37.460
The Rocks Pirates set sail!

68
00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:40.170
<b>Pirate Island of Beehive, New World</b>

69
00:04:40.630 --> 00:04:43.300
Damn! They went ahead of us!

70
00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:45.130
We gotta catch up! Hurry up!

71
00:04:45.890 --> 00:04:48.550
This is a huge deal in the world of pirates!

72
00:04:49.180 --> 00:04:52.270
All right! The game begins now!

73
00:05:04.490 --> 00:05:06.610
Guys! Look at the sea!

74
00:05:09.780 --> 00:05:13.160
There are more Marine ships than I've
 ever seen surrounding the island!

75
00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:18.040
Obviously, no one can get off this island,

76
00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:21.420
and the very fact
that such a cruel thing is happening...

77
00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:23.420
...will be erased from history!

78
00:05:24.380 --> 00:05:28.590
A game of murder to remove the natives
from the island for natural resources!

79
00:05:29.550 --> 00:05:32.470
Every last one of about 100,000 
Rabbits on the island...

80
00:05:32.520 --> 00:05:36.690
...will be dead in three weeks
when this competition is over!

81
00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:39.610
Can you believe this?!

82
00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:43.650
Are we actually in hell?!

83
00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:48.870
B-But...

84
00:05:48.910 --> 00:05:53.200
If we survive the three weeks,
we'll be free...

85
00:05:54.410 --> 00:05:56.500
That's not gonna happen!

86
00:05:56.540 --> 00:05:59.920
In all previous competitions,
there were no survivors!

87
00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:00.710
What?!

88
00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:03.840
If so, how come they gave us hope?

89
00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:07.130
If you have hope, you run for your lives!

90
00:06:07.550 --> 00:06:10.300
Killing people who sit in despair...

91
00:06:10.340 --> 00:06:11.550
...is no fun for them!

92
00:06:12.930 --> 00:06:17.230
Stop dreaming about
surviving this sick game!

93
00:06:17.270 --> 00:06:20.150
We gotta escape from the game itself!

94
00:06:20.650 --> 00:06:22.480
That's impossible...

95
00:06:31.070 --> 00:06:34.620
St. Garling has already
earned 100,000 points!

96
00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:36.870
Is he targeting high-value Rabbits?!

97
00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:44.000
All right, it came off!

98
00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:45.920
You've got a great jaw!

99
00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:48.010
It's good to have a shark Fish-Man!

100
00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:51.800
Th-Thanks!
I've never been complimented before.

101
00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:54.810
Ginny, how's it going?

102
00:06:56.020 --> 00:06:57.980
This is strange...

103
00:06:58.430 --> 00:07:00.940
I'm sure they got the information.

104
00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:03.900
But neither the pirates nor the Marines
have taken action.

105
00:07:03.940 --> 00:07:05.480
Why?!

106
00:07:05.610 --> 00:07:07.690
What are you doing?

107
00:07:09.110 --> 00:07:12.160
It's obvious, isn't it?!
I'm manipulating information!

108
00:07:12.740 --> 00:07:16.040
The prizes for the competition
are the key to our escape!

109
00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:17.370
The prizes?

110
00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:21.290
One of them is a Devil Fruit
of the strongest class which allows you...

111
00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:23.290
...to transform
into a mythical Azure Dragon!

112
00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:25.540
And the other one!

113
00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:29.380
It enables you to send yourself
and others flying to distant islands!

114
00:07:29.720 --> 00:07:32.510
It's called the Paw-Paw Fruit.
They're both here on the island!

115
00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:35.810
If one of us can eat them,

116
00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:40.230
the dozens of us can get past the Marine blockade and escape this hell!

117
00:07:40.350 --> 00:07:41.850
It's impossible!

118
00:07:41.890 --> 00:07:46.230
The prizes are at the center of the island.
They'll kill us before we find them!

119
00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:50.110
I'm a professional at thieving,
wiretapping, and transmissions!

120
00:07:50.150 --> 00:07:53.990
Two weeks ago, I leaked information
about this island to the outside!

121
00:07:54.410 --> 00:07:58.580
Soon pirates will be flooding the island
in search of treasure

122
00:07:58.620 --> 00:08:00.250
and there will be pandemonium!

123
00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:05.580
But that's not enough
to pull off the operation.

124
00:08:05.630 --> 00:08:10.170
One of us needs to attract the attention
of the Celestial Dragons as a decoy.

125
00:08:11.260 --> 00:08:12.470
A decoy...

126
00:08:15.340 --> 00:08:16.350
I'll do it.

127
00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:20.730
Kuma!

128
00:08:20.850 --> 00:08:24.940
I'm big, so I think
I can survive longer than others.

129
00:08:24.980 --> 00:08:25.690
Besides...

130
00:08:27.110 --> 00:08:30.070
I'd rather not see anyone else die...

131
00:08:32.700 --> 00:08:34.700
Heehaw!

132
00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:36.700
Well said, Kuma!

133
00:08:36.740 --> 00:08:38.990
I won't let anyone kill you!

134
00:08:39.040 --> 00:08:41.250
Let's get off God Valley together!

135
00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:50.710
"Justice"

136
00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:52.170
What's that?!

137
00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:57.300
To the east of the island!

138
00:08:58.010 --> 00:09:00.350
It's the Rocks Pirates!

139
00:09:15.820 --> 00:09:18.320
The Rocks Pirates?! Why?!

140
00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:20.030
Not only them!

141
00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:23.000
Ships of ill-famed pirates
are coming one after another!

142
00:09:23.450 --> 00:09:25.660
We haven't been told about this!
What do they want?!

143
00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:26.750
Shoot!

144
00:09:32.550 --> 00:09:34.260
It's no use, Marines!

145
00:09:36.090 --> 00:09:39.300
Follow me! Rocks Pirates!

146
00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:44.730
Hey wait, Rocks!
When did I become your subordinate?!

147
00:09:44.770 --> 00:09:45.850
You fool!

148
00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:49.310
Oh, Newgate! Not you too!

149
00:09:50.770 --> 00:09:52.860
You're so pathetic, Stussy.

150
00:09:52.980 --> 00:09:55.320
You too, Gloriosa.

151
00:09:55.440 --> 00:09:57.910
It's finders keepers!

152
00:09:57.950 --> 00:09:59.070
Any complaints?

153
00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:04.910
What are you talking about?!

154
00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:06.790
I'll have both.

155
00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:09.630
But they'd be useless to you, Linlin!

156
00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:12.960
They'll be my treasure!

157
00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:18.680
That fool, Rocks,
will surely lose sight of the goal!

158
00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:20.430
Let's check the treasure first!

159
00:10:20.850 --> 00:10:23.680
Stop acting like our leader!

160
00:10:23.720 --> 00:10:25.680
I'll send everyone flying!

161
00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:28.850
I'll just steal what I'm after
and get out of here.

162
00:10:28.890 --> 00:10:31.150
Everyone needs to stop dreaming!

163
00:10:31.270 --> 00:10:34.400
I heard that Roger's on the move, too!
I can't let him--

164
00:10:34.530 --> 00:10:35.820
Calm down, kid!

165
00:10:36.440 --> 00:10:38.070
We'll have the final battle today!

166
00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:40.450
That's the idea here!

167
00:10:40.820 --> 00:10:42.200
We'll settle it once and for all!

168
00:10:46.700 --> 00:10:48.660
The Rocks Pirates have made landfall!

169
00:10:48.790 --> 00:10:50.000
Pirates?!

170
00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:51.500
What are you doing, Marines?!

171
00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:54.340
If anything happens to us,
we will punish you-eh!

172
00:10:54.840 --> 00:10:55.670
Reporting in!

173
00:10:56.170 --> 00:10:59.720
Pirate crews are coming from all directions!
 We can't stop them!

174
00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:03.140
How did they know about this?!
This was kept strictly confidential!

175
00:11:03.600 --> 00:11:05.310
We don't know what they want!

176
00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:07.640
Watch out on the western shore!

177
00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:09.810
It's the Roger Pirates!

178
00:11:16.280 --> 00:11:20.740
Do you have any idea how I've felt
this whole year?!

179
00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:22.450
This is going to be a wild one!

180
00:11:22.570 --> 00:11:26.240
Roger! 
 No first dibs by the captain here!

181
00:11:26.370 --> 00:11:28.330
Let's go, guys!

182
00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:33.540
Pull back the soldiers and have
them guard the Celestial Dragons!

183
00:11:33.670 --> 00:11:36.710
So pathetic.
What was the point of the blockade?!

184
00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:38.550
Let's go, Holy Knights!

185
00:11:38.670 --> 00:11:39.220
Yeah.

186
00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:51.480
We have to get the prizes before them!

187
00:11:51.520 --> 00:11:52.600
We gotta hurry, Kuma!

188
00:11:52.730 --> 00:11:53.350
Okay!

189
00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:55.310
Roger... Rocks...

190
00:11:55.440 --> 00:11:58.110
We might not be able to
hold out any longer.

191
00:11:58.230 --> 00:11:59.900
- Reinforcements arrived!
- What?

192
00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:06.780
Where is he?!

193
00:12:06.830 --> 00:12:10.620
Tell me where Roger is!

194
00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:12.620
We're saved!

195
00:12:15.420 --> 00:12:17.540
Please evacuate immediately!

196
00:12:20.380 --> 00:12:22.170
Yes! We got them!

197
00:12:26.050 --> 00:12:27.550
No one's here, right?

198
00:12:28.140 --> 00:12:30.470
All right... Treasure! Treasure!

199
00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:32.020
Let's open it!

200
00:12:32.640 --> 00:12:34.310
Heehaw!

201
00:12:34.350 --> 00:12:35.730
We did it!

202
00:12:36.190 --> 00:12:37.690
Is this a Devil Fruit?

203
00:12:37.820 --> 00:12:41.940
Yeah! I don't know which is which,
but let's just eat them!

204
00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:43.570
Eat this?

205
00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:44.990
Whoa!

206
00:12:50.490 --> 00:12:51.160
Iva-chan!

207
00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:52.960
Ah!

208
00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:54.370
That was close!

209
00:12:55.420 --> 00:12:56.630
I-Iva-chan?

210
00:12:59.170 --> 00:13:01.130
I'll take that one too!

211
00:13:02.720 --> 00:13:03.720
Eat it, Kuma!

212
00:13:09.470 --> 00:13:11.560
You brat! Give it to me!

213
00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:12.520
Don't think!

214
00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:21.070
Eat it and survive, Kuma!

215
00:13:25.990 --> 00:13:27.820
If even one of us survives...

216
00:13:32.160 --> 00:13:34.660
...we win!

217
00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:40.920
You did it! Go, Kuma!

218
00:13:42.920 --> 00:13:43.710
Iva-chan!

219
00:13:45.010 --> 00:13:45.670
Kuma!

220
00:13:52.390 --> 00:13:54.560
The Buccaneer boy...

221
00:13:56.690 --> 00:14:01.400
Your only options are slavery and death.

222
00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:04.530
They were chosen for you by history itself.

223
00:14:09.490 --> 00:14:11.030
Are you important, Mister?

224
00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:17.160
It doesn't make sense
that you're born important...

225
00:14:17.210 --> 00:14:21.920
And if you're born into slavery,
there's no point to being born at all!

226
00:14:23.300 --> 00:14:27.300
If I've got some kind of power,

227
00:14:28.180 --> 00:14:30.340
just like Nika,

228
00:14:30.390 --> 00:14:35.470
I want to save as many of
these poor people as possible!

229
00:14:36.020 --> 00:14:39.060
Which is why you people
will vanish for good.

230
00:14:42.940 --> 00:14:44.320
Wait, Rocks!

231
00:14:44.440 --> 00:14:46.320
You're in my way, Roger!

232
00:14:46.650 --> 00:14:50.490
This incident would fade into
the dark shadows of history.

233
00:14:51.160 --> 00:14:57.620
<b>Sorbet Kingdom,
 South Blue</b>

234
00:14:52.910 --> 00:14:54.950
Garp's heroic tale.

235
00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:57.620
Is that all the information they'll reveal?

236
00:14:58.080 --> 00:15:00.790
The world is as the powerful
want it to be.

237
00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:03.540
This reporter named Morgans is garbage.

238
00:15:03.920 --> 00:15:08.470
We have no idea
what happened to that island after all.

239
00:15:08.510 --> 00:15:09.430
Now,

240
00:15:09.470 --> 00:15:11.800
how long are you gonna keep praying, Kuma?

241
00:15:13.510 --> 00:15:17.430
When I think that there were
still lives I could have saved...

242
00:15:17.560 --> 00:15:19.390
Cut it out!

243
00:15:19.440 --> 00:15:23.810
In all that chaos,
you saved over 500 lives!

244
00:15:23.940 --> 00:15:26.900
He's right, Kumachi!
That was unbelievable!

245
00:15:26.940 --> 00:15:29.150
They all thanked you in tears!

246
00:15:29.190 --> 00:15:31.070
It brought me to tears, too!

247
00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:33.200
But...

248
00:15:34.410 --> 00:15:36.950
Your hands liberated people.

249
00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:39.160
Those are the Hands of Liberation!

250
00:15:39.790 --> 00:15:41.120
The Hands of...

251
00:15:41.620 --> 00:15:42.330
...Liberation...

252
00:15:43.080 --> 00:15:44.710
You're strong.

253
00:15:44.750 --> 00:15:47.420
Endure! Endure and survive!

254
00:15:47.460 --> 00:15:49.340
The Warrior of Liberation will come!

255
00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:56.220
So your family ran a church...

256
00:15:56.260 --> 00:15:58.640
It explains so much about you.

257
00:16:04.440 --> 00:16:07.400
All right, I'm gonna sail out to sea!

258
00:16:07.440 --> 00:16:09.400
To enjoy my freedom!

259
00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:12.700
I'll never forget your face!

260
00:16:14.320 --> 00:16:16.160
No one ever has!

261
00:16:16.280 --> 00:16:21.160
I'll stay here with Kumachi and figure
out what to do with my life, Big Bro!

262
00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:23.620
I like that idea!

263
00:16:25.330 --> 00:16:28.090
Goodbye, my friends!

264
00:16:33.630 --> 00:16:34.300
Now!

265
00:16:35.260 --> 00:16:39.060
Since I'm four years older than you,
I have to feed you!

266
00:16:39.520 --> 00:16:40.220
Huh?

267
00:16:42.100 --> 00:16:43.390
I'm gonna chop firewood!

268
00:16:47.980 --> 00:16:49.070
Ow, ow, ow...

269
00:16:49.190 --> 00:16:50.820
Ginny, are you okay?

270
00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:53.780
Should I chop it with this?

271
00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:55.490
Yeah!

272
00:17:00.620 --> 00:17:02.750
Chop, Kumachi!

273
00:17:04.830 --> 00:17:05.790
All right!

274
00:17:05.830 --> 00:17:07.040
Let's sell them!

275
00:17:07.170 --> 00:17:07.920
Yeah.

276
00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:11.210
No more scavenging or stealing!

277
00:17:11.260 --> 00:17:13.590
Let's earn money and buy food!

278
00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:14.380
Yeah.

279
00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:16.220
Let's do it!

280
00:17:16.340 --> 00:17:17.140
Yeah.

281
00:17:19.970 --> 00:17:21.310
We're sold out!

282
00:17:21.430 --> 00:17:22.060
Yeah.

283
00:17:22.180 --> 00:17:24.310
I'm starving!

284
00:17:24.350 --> 00:17:25.770
What should we eat today?

285
00:17:26.190 --> 00:17:28.150
Whatever you like.

286
00:17:28.270 --> 00:17:29.310
Yay!

287
00:17:29.360 --> 00:17:30.690
Well, then...

288
00:17:32.570 --> 00:17:34.360
You two don't look familiar!

289
00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:35.030
You don't!

290
00:17:35.740 --> 00:17:37.820
You're big! How old are you?

291
00:17:38.410 --> 00:17:39.740
I'm nine.

292
00:17:39.870 --> 00:17:41.990
What?! Nine?!

293
00:17:43.830 --> 00:17:45.080
Mm-hm, mm-hm.

294
00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:47.580
You liar!

295
00:17:48.500 --> 00:17:50.090
- You monster!
- Ouch!

296
00:17:50.210 --> 00:17:51.000
Stop it!

297
00:17:52.130 --> 00:17:54.920
Come on! Don't bully Kumachi!

298
00:17:55.050 --> 00:17:55.840
Ginny!

299
00:18:00.140 --> 00:18:04.140
I'm sorry... Ginny is actually very nice.

300
00:18:09.270 --> 00:18:09.810
What?

301
00:18:10.560 --> 00:18:13.360
- It healed!
- The pain's gone!

302
00:18:13.480 --> 00:18:14.650
Was it magic?!

303
00:18:14.780 --> 00:18:17.610
- That was amazing, Kumachi!
- Awesome!

304
00:18:18.610 --> 00:18:23.580
Kumachi! Kumachi!

305
00:18:26.370 --> 00:18:27.330
Let's eat.

306
00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:28.670
Let's eat!

307
00:18:34.710 --> 00:18:35.800
I want more.

308
00:18:35.920 --> 00:18:37.260
- Here.
- Are you sure?!

309
00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:43.720
Yummy!

310
00:18:43.850 --> 00:18:47.310
Since you eat so much,
we need to work a lot.

311
00:18:47.770 --> 00:18:48.640
Yeah!

312
00:18:52.730 --> 00:18:55.480
Kumachi, when did you become a slave?

313
00:18:58.900 --> 00:18:59.700
When I was four.

314
00:18:59.820 --> 00:19:01.240
Me too!

315
00:19:01.370 --> 00:19:03.660
It's not something to celebrate...

316
00:19:06.750 --> 00:19:08.370
I'm full!

317
00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:10.290
I'm full...!

318
00:19:11.040 --> 00:19:13.130
I'm... full...

319
00:19:13.840 --> 00:19:15.090
Hm? Ginny?

320
00:19:18.470 --> 00:19:20.430
Kumachi!

321
00:19:44.700 --> 00:19:45.990
Kumachi!

322
00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:55.460
I'm starving!
What should we eat today?

323
00:20:01.260 --> 00:20:03.680
Whatever you like.

324
00:20:06.470 --> 00:20:07.850
Kumachi...!

325
00:20:13.270 --> 00:20:17.070
What? Don't cry, Ginny!

326
00:20:39.300 --> 00:20:40.670
I'm so happy.

327
00:20:57.560 --> 00:21:02.860
I can't protect anyone again
mata daremo mamorenai no

328
00:21:02.860 --> 00:21:07.660
It's my fault that the voice is fading away
kiekakaru koe wa boku no sei

329
00:21:07.660 --> 00:21:09.950
I don't even have time to look down
utsumuku hima mo nai no

330
00:21:09.950 --> 00:21:12.540
Gravel marks on my palms
tenohira ni tsuku jari no ato

331
00:21:12.540 --> 00:21:15.920
Start moving again, my ship
mata ugokidase boku no fune yo

332
00:21:16.330 --> 00:21:21.420
Though I can't fly in the broad sky
hiroi sora wa tobenai kedo

333
00:21:21.420 --> 00:21:27.300
I can light up the deep sea
fukai umi wa teraseru kara

334
00:21:27.430 --> 00:21:28.260
We
bokura wa

335
00:21:28.350 --> 00:21:30.760
EVERYDAY owarenai
EVERYDAY, can't let this be the end

336
00:21:30.760 --> 00:21:33.390
EVERYDAY makerenai
EVERYDAY, can't be defeated

337
00:21:33.390 --> 00:21:37.150
We have something here to protect
mamoru mono ga koko niwa aru

338
00:21:37.190 --> 00:21:39.690
This may not be what I expected
yosou chigai kamo?

339
00:21:39.770 --> 00:21:42.400
But we can't stop now
tomarenai yo mou

340
00:21:42.480 --> 00:21:47.700
We go on, sharing loneliness
kodoku wo ima wakeai susumu

341
00:21:47.820 --> 00:21:50.450
Don't be afraid
ojikedzukuna yo

342
00:21:50.530 --> 00:21:54.410
I'm not the same person I was that day
ano hi no boku to chigau kara

343
00:21:54.450 --> 00:21:57.870
No one can stand in my way
dare nimo jama dekinai yo

344
00:21:58.630 --> 00:21:59.500
Now, move aside
saa doite

345
00:21:59.540 --> 00:22:02.090
Conquer the world, believe in the future
sekai wo seishite mirai wo shinjite

346
00:22:02.210 --> 00:22:04.670
Count up the nights
ikutsu mono yoru kazoete

347
00:22:04.670 --> 00:22:07.380
What did you see? What did you learn?
nani wo mite nani wo shitte

348
00:22:07.380 --> 00:22:10.390
To realize what was important
taisetsu na koto ni kidzuita no
